{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"综合评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-godfather-of-ai-computing","title":"人工智能计算的教父","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-godfather-of-ai-computing","wordCount":1640,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1631,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"综合评价\">综合评价</h1><p>本章在客观审视争议的基础上，对黄仁勋做出全面的综合评价。一方面，充分肯定他作为&quot;人工智能计算教父&quot;的卓越贡献与非凡远见；另一方面，也客观地正视围绕英伟达的争议与不确定。两篇文档，分别呈现人工智能计算的教父，以及一个全面而辩证的评判。</p>\n"}